\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cenbank net sold $179 mln in spot in Dec,  \highlight22\uc2 intervened \highlight\uc2  in futures -bulletin\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 2016\par 13:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Feb 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a net $179 million in spot exchange markets in December compared with net buying of $15 million in November, while also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the futures markets, it said in a monthly bulletin on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 In spot markets, the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  bought $2.6 billion but sold $2.8 billion in December, showing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  both to curb the rupee's value and to cap its gains.\par \par \uc2 The RBI did not provide a breakdown of sales or purchases for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures in December, only saying that its actions had totalled $1.22 billion worth of trades.\par \par \uc2 Traders however said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely more active selling dollar/rupee futures to prevent a sharp fall in the rupee.\par \par \uc2 The trading in futures was less than the $2.37 billion in November, according to the RBI table. The RBI started detailing its activity in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures last month.\par \par \uc2 The rupee moved in the 66.0850-67.1250 per dollar range in December when the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  hiked interest rates for the first time in a decade.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's outstanding forward purchases stood at $1.99 billion as of December-end compared to $1.49 billion in November, the data showed. (Reporting by Suvashree Dey Choudhury; Editing by Biju Dwarakanath) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-2-10T13:32:08.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160210ec2a00hak\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
