\par\par \b \uc2 RPT- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank\uc2  says  \highlight22\uc2 intervening \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  futures markets - traders\b0\par\par\uc2 500 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Dezember 2015\par 22:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Repeats ahead of Asian markets open)\par \par \uc2 By Neha Dasgupta\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, Dec 9 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the rupee \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official told a gathering of bank trainees last week, according to four people briefed on the comments.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a separate statement issued on late Wednesday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the exchange traded \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  derivatives market if required, however, it did not specify if it has been active in that market.\par \par \uc2 The rare admission of the RBI's moves to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by an official comes as global central banks prepare for the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 's historic policy decision next week at which it is widely expected to raise interest rates for the first time in more than a decade.\par \par \uc2 The official, who is closely involved with the RBI's market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , made the comment at a workshop for about 40 trainees from trading rooms at banks on Saturday, according to senior traders from four institutions who say they were informed of the comment by the trainees. The traders declined to be named because they are not authorised to speak to media about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The RBI did not have a comment on questions about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , when asked about the workshop.\par \par \uc2 In response to a query from bank trainees on the RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, the official said at Saturday's event the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market but did not provide additional details, the traders told Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The RBI has traditionally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  spot markets, and it manages the rupee flows resulting from that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through the forwards market.\par \par \uc2 Although the RBI was widely believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures in 2013, when the rupee plunged to a record low as the Fed prepared to end its quantitative easing program, it never confirmed any action.\par \par \uc2 The RBI also introduced temporary curbs in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures trading, including a ban on proprietary trading that lasted about a year and was lifted in June 2014.\par \par \uc2 Direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in futures markets would likely be carried out by state-run banks as is the case in spot markets, according to traders, and would magnify the RBI's presence and limit the scope of arbitrage between spot and futures markets.\par \par \uc2 The rupee fell 2.1 percent against the dollar in November, making it the worst-performing emerging Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It has since fallen further in December, hitting a more than two-year low last week.\par \par \uc2 That has spurred RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in spot markets during this period, according to traders, including more recently on Dec. 4.\par \par \uc2 But traders briefed on the official's comment on Saturday said they were not sure if the RBI had also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in futures markets, and say any action would have likely been quite small. (Editing by Rafael Nam and Sam Holmes) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-12-9T22:00:01.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020151209ebc900u9p\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Rajan Says  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Has Enough Reserves To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  To Check Rupee Volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 2015\par \uc2 RTT News\par \uc2 RTTNEW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 2015 NoticiasFinancieras. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (RTTNews) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sufficient \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to curb any possible volatility in the rupee, the Reserve Bank of India Governor \uc2 Raghuram Rajan\uc2  said Monday.\par \par \uc2 The country has about $355 billion in reserves and another $25 billion in forward contracts, so \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves totaling $380 billion available to use when needed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief said at a banking conference in Mumbai.\par \par \uc2 The RBI will not hesitate to make use of the reserves when needed, Rajan said. "We try and prevent undue volatility...if we see undue volatility, we have the resources to deal with that," he said.\par \par \uc2 The Indian rupee fell sharply on Monday to a two-year low on the backdrop of steep declines in the global markets over fears of a severe Chinese slowdown. The Indian stock market also plunged with the benchmark Sensex tumbling more than 1,000 points during the day. The peer index Nifty slumped nearly 500 points.\par \par \uc2 Rajan also noted that India has come a long way since the 2012-13 crisis and is now in a better position than its peers in terms of economic fundamentals, to withstand any volatility in financial markets.\par \par \uc2 That said, Rajan pointed out that India's economic growth is still below potential, inflation remains high and stressed assets in the financial system continue to be high, limiting growth and new lending.\par \par \uc2 For comments and feedback: contact editorial@rttnews.com\par \par \uc2 Copyright(c) 2015 RTTNews.com. All Rights Reserved\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTTNEW0020150824eb8o002mh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
