nufacturing PMIs coming in a touch better than prior expectations, the broadly weaker dollar should translate into a heavier tone for the USD/SGD in the near term," OCBC says in a note. The house tips the pair in an easier 1.3400-1.3500 range on Wednesday. (gaurav.raghuvanshi@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0454 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  ] \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reliance Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2  (500325.BY), owner of the world's biggest crude oil refining complex, has raised $750 million through senior unsecured notes due 2045. The notes will be denominated in US dollars, and will bear fixed interest of 4.875%, with interest payable semi-annually in arrears The funds will be used for the company's ongoing capital expenditures. The notes were more than 3.07 times over-subscribed across 167 accounts. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of America Merrill Lynch\f28 \uc2 \f2  , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Barclays Bank PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Citigroup Global Markets Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2  . and \f28 \uc2 \f2 The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corporation\f28 \uc2 \f2  acted as joint managers. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Moody's\f28 \uc2 \f2  Tuesday assigned a Baa2 senior unsecured foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  debt rating with a stable outlook to the issuance.(saurabh.chaturvedi@wsj.com; @journosaurabh) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0446 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2  ] The USD/CNY is lower today, tracking guidance set by the \f28 \uc2 \f2 PBOC\f28 \uc2 \f2  Wednesday. The pair is now at 6.2491, vs Tuesday's close at 6.2581. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  set central parity at 6.1318 vs Tuesday parity at 6.1369. A weaker reading for the \f28 \uc2 \f2 HSBC\f28 \uc2 \f2  China services purchasing managers index, which fell to a six-month low at 51.8 in January vs 53.4 in December, didn't manage to offset t