ke. G2 is registered in India and is focused on constructing a large commercial "\f28 \uc2 \f2 Infospace\f28 \uc2 \f2 " development at Dundahera, Gurgaon. The land under development is notified as IT (Information Technology)/ITES (IT Enabled Services) SEZ (Special Economic Zone) under the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indian government\f28 \uc2 \f2 's 2005 SEZ Act. The total size of the development is 2.84 million sq.ft. of which 2.41 million sq.ft. was \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and drawing lease rental income at 30 September 2013. The construction of the UDPL development is the most advanced of the constructions in the portfolio. The development is being actively marketed and has been classified as held for sale in accordance with IFRS 5: Non-current Assets Held for Sale and Discontinued \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . See note 8.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    4.   Shantiniketan Properties Limited ("N1") \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Company has a 60% interest in N1 as part of a joint development arrangement with the other party. N1 is registered in India and is focused on constructing a large commercial "\f28 \uc2 \f2 Infospace\f28 \uc2 \f2 " development at Sector 62, Noida. The total size of the proposed development potential is 2.15 million sq.ft. of which 0.66 million sq.ft. was \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 30 September 2013.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    5.   Seaview Developers Limited ("N2") \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Company has a 60% interest in N2 as part of a joint development arrangement with the other party. N2 is registered in India and is focused on constructing a large commercial "\f28 \uc2 \f2 Infospace\f28 \uc2 \f2 " development at Sector 135, Noida. The land under development is notified as IT (Information Technology)/ITES (IT Enabled Services) SEZ (Special Economic Zone) under the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indian government\f28 \uc2 \f2 's 2005 SEZ Act. The total size of the proposed development potential is 3.35 million sq.ft. of which 1.59 million sq.ft. was \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operational\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 30 September 2013.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    6.   Unitech Infra-Con Limited ("N3") \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Company has a 60% interest in N3 as part of a joint development arrangement with the other party. N3 is registered in India and is focused on constructing a large commercial "\f28 \uc2 \f2 Infospace\f28 \uc2 \f2 " development in the Greater Noida Technical Zone. The development site consists of a 50 acre parcel of land which is notified as IT (Information Technology)/ITES (IT Enabled Services) SEZ (Special Economic Zone) under the \f28 \uc2 \f2 Indian government\f28 \uc2 \f2 's 2005 SEZ Act. The total size of the proposed development potential is 4.95 million sq.ft. As at 30 September no construction work had been undertaken on the land.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    a)         Share of profits of equity-accounted joint ventures, net of tax \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Summarised statement of comprehensive income\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par                                                                 Unaudited          Unaudited      Audited \par                                                          six months ended   six months ended   Year ended \par                                                                 30-Sep-13          30-Sep-12    31-Mar-13 \par                                                                  GBP '000           GBP '000     GBP '000 \par  Income \par  Investment property revenue                                       17,456             13,280       28,943 \par  Finance income                                                     2,294                 70        4,256 \par  Loss on amortisation of security deposits (b)                      (657)            (2,780)      (2,323) \par  Net gain from fair value adjustments                   