\par\par \b \uc2 EXCLUSIVE-Emerging markets planning joint offshore  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2 -Indian official\b0\par\par\uc2 401 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 2013\par 13:38\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 NEW DELHI, Aug 30 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is liaising with other emerging-economy countries on a plan to co-ordinate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in offshore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets blamed for fuelling a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rout over the past three months, a senior \uc2 Indian finance ministry\uc2  official said on Friday.\par \par \uc2 "It is now time to stop," Dipak Dasgupta, the ministry's principal economic adviser, told Reuters, referring to the speculation he said was damaging the stability of the world economy.\par \par \uc2 Dasgupta said there had been correspondence among the countries on the plans in the last few weeks and predicted action would come quickly, but he declined to share specific details of the discussions.\par \par \uc2 "It is going to happen in a matter of days rather than weeks," he said. "Brazil and India can start the move."\par \par \uc2 It was not immediately clear how many takers there were for such a proposal from other major emerging economies.\par \par \uc2 Offshore markets developed to allow foreign investors to hedge or speculate on emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  when exchange controls in those countries made it difficult to trade directly in the domestic spot market.\par \par \uc2 Dasgupta said such markets had exerted pressure on 12 of the main emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including Brazil, China, India, Russia, South Africa, Turkey, and Malaysia.\par \par \uc2 He said that, acting together, even four or five members would have estimated international reserves of $1.2 trillion. With China, the total reserves exceed $6 trillion, he said.\par \par \uc2 "Once they decide they will move to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to mutually support each other to put a floor, there is no force that can stop the impact," he said.\par \par \uc2 India's rupee \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is only partly convertible, making it theoretically impossible to directly speculate in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. The rupee is the worst performing major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent months, having lost about 20 percent against the dollar since May.\par \par \uc2 Non-deliverable forward (NDF) markets operating mainly from Singapore allow trade in several Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the rupee. They allow investors to bet without ever having to physically exchange the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  involved.\par \par \uc2 In July, Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Duvvuri Subbarao said he would rather there were no NDF markets. (Reporting by Manoj Kumar; Editing by John Chalmers and Neil Fullick)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -RUPEE/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (EXCLUSIVE) | SNS | SNI | Z | SF | SI | PHD | J | UKI | C | D | E | M | O | U | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL | ABX | BNX | FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130902e98u000k7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
