\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ  \highlight22\uc2 India Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Likely  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Markets - Traders\b0\par\par\uc2 309 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 2013\par 13:22\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 26 Aug 2013 07:23 EDT *DJ  India RBI Likely Sold Dollars From INR64.70 - Traders\par \par \uc2 26 Aug 2013 07:55 EDT DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  Rupee Partially Recovers on Suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 By Khushita Vasant and Sudeep Jain\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI--\b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market toward the close of local trading Monday, helping the rupee \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to recoup some of its intraday losses against the U.S. dollar, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  is believed to have sold dollars when the greenback was trading at 64.70 rupees, they said. The rupee was at 64.30 when trading ended in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday, compared with an intraday high of 64.73 and 63.20 Friday.\par \par \uc2 The RBI also likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday, helping the rupee gain 2.1% against the U.S. dollar during the session, dealers said. Friday's gain came after the rupee fell to a record low against the U.S. dollar in each of the five sessions through Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The rupee has been hurt particularly hard by a global shift away from emerging-market assets amid expectations that the U.S. Federal Reserve will soon taper its monetary stimulus. The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is down more than 16% against the greenback since the start of May due to fears that India will struggle to fund its current-account deficit if global liquidity conditions tighten.\par \par \uc2 The RBI has a stated policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to reduce volatility. It doesn't comment on specific \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and releases data on its foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions with a two-month lag.\par \par \uc2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@wsj.com and Sudeep Jain at sudeep.jain@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 August 26, 2013 07:55 ET (11:55 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020130826e98q001o6\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (india near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\wid